      "text": "Doping in sport is an arms race between performance biochemistry and analytical chemistry. Understanding it requires: knowing what the substances do physiologically, why they work, and why detection is hard. It is also a policy and measurement system — the WADA framework is a global governance structure with its own logic and limitations."
